speechtext:
Resolved that it is expedient to provide that the following goods shall he exempt from the provisions of section 3 of chapter 3 of the Acts of 1915 ;
(r)	materials imported to he used; in the manufacture of goods enumerated in tariff items 446, 446b, 446c, 447, 448, 449, 4'5'0 and 591 ;
(s)	olive oil and peanut oil for canning flsh ;
(t)	materials imported prior to the first day of September, 1920, to be used in the manufacture of oleomargarine as described in The Dairy Industry Act, 1914, and amendments thereto;
(u)	linen or cotton clothing, n.o.p;
